.Dd October 2026
.Dt MYLS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm myls
.Nd list directory contents (midterm re-implementation of ls)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl 1ACGacdFfhiklnqRrSstuw
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lists files and directories like
.Xr ls 1 .
It implements the options
.Fl AacdFfhiklnqRrSstuw
from the NetBSD manual, plus the extensions below.
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl 1
One entry per line (default when output is not a terminal).
.It Fl C
Multi-column output, filled top to bottom (default on a terminal).
.It Fl G
Colour names by file type with ANSI escape codes.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 if any operand could not be listed or output failed.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ls 1
